{
  "name": "Enrich contractor list with 12-month building permit history & WA license status (Apify)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Enrich contractor list with 12-month building permit history & WA license status\n\n**What it does:** reads contractor names or license numbers from a Google Sheet, calls the Apify Actor *Building Permit History API — Contractor & Address Lookup* (`RickyZ1X~permit-history-lookup-api`) across 6 US jurisdictions (Austin, San Diego County, NYC, Seattle, LA, Chicago) plus Washington State L&I, and writes back each contractor's 12-month permit count, solar/roofing/HVAC breakdown, total project valuation, and license/insurance expiration dates.\n\n### Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. **Apify token**: Apify Console -> Settings -> API & Integrations -> copy your personal API token. In *Lookup Permit History (Apify)* create a **Header Auth** credential: Name = `Authorization`, Value = `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN`.\n2. **Google Sheets**: create a spreadsheet with two tabs: `Input` (columns: `Company Name, License Number`) and `Enriched` (columns: `Company Name, License Number, Matched, Permits Last 12m, Total Valuation USD, Last Permit Date, Top Categories, WA License Status, Insurance Expiry, Bond Cancel Date, Verified Phone`).\n3. Paste your spreadsheet ID into both Google Sheets nodes.\n4. Click **Test workflow** to enrich your list.\n\n### Cost\nBilled to *your* Apify account per matched lookup (`lookup` event); no-match lookups are free. The Apify free plan's monthly credit covers testing hundreds of rows.\n\n### Compliance\nB2B contractor business records only, sourced from official municipal open-data portals and state licensing boards. Contains no homeowner names or consumer contact data.",
        "height": 680,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "9c3d4a10-0001-4c1a-9b10-c0c0c0c00001",
      "name": "Setup & compliance",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -700,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "9c3d4a10-0002-4c1a-9b10-c0c0c0c00002",
      "name": "When clicking 'Test workflow'",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Input",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9c3d4a10-0003-4c1a-9b10-c0c0c0c00003",
      "name": "Read contractors from Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/RickyZ1X~permit-history-lookup-api/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "timeout",
              "value": "120"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"contractorName\": {{ JSON.stringify($json['Company Name'] || '') }},\n  \"licenseNumber\": {{ JSON.stringify($json['License Number'] || '') }},\n  \"monthsBack\": 12,\n  \"maxPermitsPerLookup\": 10\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 130000
        }
      },
      "id": "9c3d4a10-0004-4c1a-9b10-c0c0c0c00004",
      "name": "Lookup Permit History (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Header Auth credential: Authorization = Bearer YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c3f0c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "name": "Company Name",
              "value": "={{ $json.query?.contractorName || $json.license?.company_name || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3f0c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
              "name": "License Number",
              "value": "={{ $json.query?.licenseNumber || $json.license?.license_number || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3f0c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
              "name": "Matched",
              "value": "={{ String(Boolean($json.matched)) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3f0c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
              "name": "Permits Last 12m",
              "value": "={{ String($json.permits_summary?.last_12_months ?? 0) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3f0c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
              "name": "Total Valuation USD",
              "value": "={{ String($json.permits_summary?.valuation_usd_total ?? '') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3f0c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
              "name": "Last Permit Date",
              "value": "={{ $json.permits_summary?.last_issued ?? '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3f0c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
              "name": "Top Categories",
              "value": "={{ Object.entries($json.permits_summary?.by_category ?? {}).map(([k, v]) => `${k}:${v}`).join(', ') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3f0c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
              "name": "WA License Status",
              "value": "={{ $json.license?.license_status ?? '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3f0c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
              "name": "Insurance Expiry",
              "value": "={{ $json.license?.insurance_expiration_date ?? '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3f0c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
              "name": "Bond Cancel Date",
              "value": "={{ $json.license?.bond_cancel_date ?? '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3f0c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
              "name": "Verified Phone",
              "value": "={{ $json.license?.phone_e164 ?? $json.recent_permits?.[0]?.contractor?.phone_e164 ?? '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9c3d4a10-0005-4c1a-9b10-c0c0c0c00005",
      "name": "Flatten enriched profile",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
